  "question": "Which caf\u00e9 comes up first when traveling toward West Wing, Philadelphia, PA from Super Cichlids Inc, Dover, DE?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.496486 39.155267)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.150356 39.948942)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.496486 39.155267)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.496486 39.155267)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
